   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "Their answer shocked the old world: the nation. Not the king."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "On Saint Joseph's day, 1812, they proclaimed a constitution. Spaniards nicknamed it La Pepa.",
