   "text": "Not exactly. Two years later, King Ferdinand came home, and tore it up."
  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "In 1820, an officer named Rafael del Riego rebelled. The king was forced to swear loyalty to La Pepa.",
